      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. one more thing—we're worried about the opposition from traditional conservationists who think rewilding is just too risky. can you include a section that addresses their concerns but basically shows that their cautious approach is actually just an excuse for inaction and that they're stuck in the past?",
